## Self-Heal: Failure Analyst Summary
Root cause: Agent called getLinkHref and getDataCslp on ContentstackLivePreview, but these methods do not exist in the installed @contentstack/live-preview-utils package.
Fix: Do NOT call ContentstackLivePreview.getLinkHref() or ContentstackLivePreview.getDataCslp() — these methods do not exist on the default export of @contentstack/live-preview-utils. Before using any method on a third-party package, grep its dist/*.d.ts files for the actual exported API. If the live-preview methods you need are not found, omit the live-preview props entirely rather than inventing method names.
